WEBVTT


00:00:44.582 --> 00:00:48.219
Tao Sor now knows, that he's not my real brother!

00:00:50.655 --> 00:00:53.758
I have to do everything to make him forget,

00:00:54.425 --> 00:00:56.294
and come back to being the Tao Sor I know!

00:00:56.694 --> 00:00:58.830
Why do you have to go this far?

00:00:59.430 --> 00:01:00.932
I'm protecting you.

00:01:01.666 --> 00:01:02.734
That's not true.

00:01:03.668 --> 00:01:05.470
Both you and Mom know well, don't you?

00:01:08.573 --> 00:01:09.874
Kim..

00:01:11.576 --> 00:01:12.677
where are you?

00:01:14.479 --> 00:01:15.680
Come see me.

00:01:17.582 --> 00:01:19.450
I'm waiting on the bridge.

00:01:20.919 --> 00:01:22.320
Okay, alright.

00:01:22.854 --> 00:01:23.988
I'll hurry there.

00:01:24.556 --> 00:01:25.757
Wait for me, Tao Sor.

00:01:26.357 --> 00:01:27.392
Wait for me.

00:01:27.458 --> 00:01:31.663
I thought I was dead, but I was able to wake up.

00:01:32.096 --> 00:01:35.466
Then I found out that I've been Sleeping Beauty for over 3 years.

00:01:35.466 --> 00:01:37.302
And your son and boyfriend?

00:01:37.302 --> 00:01:40.271
My husband lost his life at sea,

00:01:40.271 --> 00:01:44.809
as for my son, he was swallowed by the sea, disappearing without a trace.

00:01:44.809 --> 00:01:47.145
At first, I couldn't take it.

00:01:47.512 --> 00:01:49.113
I tried to find him,

00:01:49.447 --> 00:01:52.951
but the officers said it's already been 3 years.

00:01:53.218 --> 00:01:56.254
If they could, then they would have already found him.

00:01:56.487 --> 00:02:00.158
The boy that this woman is talking about is me?

00:02:00.692 --> 00:02:01.292
Yes.

00:02:02.160 --> 00:02:04.195
I'm not sure either, but I think so.

00:02:05.230 --> 00:02:07.065
So we have hurry and get you to see her.

00:02:07.732 --> 00:02:12.337
I promised you, that I would help you find your real mom.

00:02:23.648 --> 00:02:24.515
Don't answer.

00:02:25.383 --> 00:02:27.151
Let me take you to see your other first,

00:02:28.620 --> 00:02:30.388
and then I'll tell you everything.

00:02:48.906 --> 00:02:49.874
This way!

00:02:55.480 --> 00:02:56.447
We have to got there!

00:03:11.329 --> 00:03:12.997
Tao Sor.

00:03:14.132 --> 00:03:15.733
I think...

00:03:17.969 --> 00:03:20.972
we didn't make it.

00:03:23.308 --> 00:03:24.208
So...

00:03:26.144 --> 00:03:28.413
What should we do, Kim?

00:04:50.094 --> 00:04:52.663
I'm..sorry.

00:04:53.231 --> 00:04:56.200
For not being able to find your real mom like I promised.

00:05:00.805 --> 00:05:02.106
Don't worry.

00:05:03.207 --> 00:05:04.409
From now on,

00:05:05.176 --> 00:05:07.211
I'll take care of you.

00:05:11.149 --> 00:05:12.417
Thank you.

00:05:13.885 --> 00:05:16.287
Why are you thanking me? We're dating, after all.

00:05:25.296 --> 00:05:28.299
Let's...go get your things from your house.

00:05:35.273 --> 00:05:37.408
How's it going, Talay?

00:05:39.644 --> 00:05:40.945
He turbed off his phone.

00:05:41.379 --> 00:05:44.582
He looks tired, he might faint somewhere.

00:05:46.284 --> 00:05:48.419
I think I should go look for him myself.

00:05:48.853 --> 00:05:50.087
Talay, stay with mom.

00:05:50.288 --> 00:05:51.255
Calm down, Dad.

00:05:52.657 --> 00:05:53.825
He'll be back.

00:06:05.269 --> 00:06:06.337
It's you again?

00:06:07.171 --> 00:06:08.573
Where'd you take Tao Sor?!

00:06:08.806 --> 00:06:10.808
When will you leave Tao Sor's life?

00:06:11.108 --> 00:06:12.343
Probably too late now, man.

00:06:13.010 --> 00:06:15.980
Because Tao Sor's promised, that he'll stay with me.

00:06:18.382 --> 00:06:20.384
Tao Sor, come to Mommy!

00:06:20.618 --> 00:06:21.385
Mom?

00:06:21.953 --> 00:06:24.922
Just now, I went to go see my mom with Kim.

00:06:27.391 --> 00:06:28.226
Hey, Kim.

00:06:29.093 --> 00:06:30.628
What lies have you feeding Tao Sor?

00:06:30.728 --> 00:06:32.163
I just told him the truth.

00:06:32.563 --> 00:06:33.464
Another thing...

00:06:33.631 --> 00:06:36.601
he's promised with me that he'll stay with me.

00:06:37.502 --> 00:06:38.269
Let's go pack your things.

00:06:38.669 --> 00:06:39.770
Look, Tao Sor...

00:06:41.906 --> 00:06:42.974
Don't listen to him.

00:06:43.841 --> 00:06:45.309
You are my brother.

00:06:45.776 --> 00:06:47.178
and these are your parents!

00:06:47.578 --> 00:06:48.913
If you don't believe me...

00:06:50.648 --> 00:06:51.649
take a look at this.

00:06:53.784 --> 00:06:55.152
It's a picture of our family.

00:06:55.453 --> 00:06:56.854
Even if you don't remember,

00:06:57.054 --> 00:06:58.222
these memories...

00:06:58.523 --> 00:06:59.991
hold so much meaning to us.

00:07:00.191 --> 00:07:02.927
Tao Sor, you will always be my son.

00:07:02.927 --> 00:07:04.161
Don't leave.

00:07:04.896 --> 00:07:05.630
Tao Sor.

00:07:06.631 --> 00:07:08.499
He's only known you for a few months,

00:07:08.900 --> 00:07:10.868
he only thinks about his own needs.

00:07:11.869 --> 00:07:13.170
He doesn't care about what you need.

00:07:13.504 --> 00:07:14.305
Not true!

00:07:14.739 --> 00:07:17.041
Everything I said has been the truth.

00:07:17.308 --> 00:07:19.410
And I also want Tao Sor to live his own life.

00:07:19.544 --> 00:07:21.712
Not accept that he's just a person you took in.

00:07:23.414 --> 00:07:24.682
Tao Sor, let's go.

00:07:24.982 --> 00:07:25.449
Tao Sor.

00:07:28.886 --> 00:07:29.654
That's enough, Talay.

00:07:30.621 --> 00:07:32.023
If you really love Tao Sor,

00:07:32.523 --> 00:07:34.191
you'd want him to have his own life.

00:07:34.625 --> 00:07:35.393
Just this...

00:07:36.127 --> 00:07:38.095
you've already ruined his life far enough.

00:07:38.095 --> 00:07:39.630
You're the one that needs to get out.

00:07:39.697 --> 00:07:41.499
You have to get out of our lives.

00:07:42.600 --> 00:07:43.801
We were doing fine,

00:07:44.402 --> 00:07:45.803
but you came and messed with everything.

00:07:45.803 --> 00:07:46.871
I will leave!

00:07:47.538 --> 00:07:48.773
but Tao Sor's coming with me.

00:07:49.540 --> 00:07:50.908
tao Sor's not going anywhere.

00:07:50.908 --> 00:07:52.209
This is his home,

00:07:52.710 --> 00:07:53.945
his family....

00:07:54.946 --> 00:07:56.347
Tao Sor, come with me.

00:07:56.447 --> 00:07:57.281
Tao Sor leaves with me!

00:07:57.381 --> 00:07:58.549
You're the one that needs to leave.

00:07:59.283 --> 00:08:00.551
But Tao Sor's agreed with me.

00:08:00.751 --> 00:08:02.386
Tao Sor's decided to go with me!

00:08:02.386 --> 00:08:03.087
Tao Sor, stay with me.

00:08:03.087 --> 00:08:04.488
That's enough!

00:08:09.627 --> 00:08:11.929
I don't know who to trust anymore!

00:08:15.066 --> 00:08:16.734
Tao Sor, don't go anywhere!

00:08:17.301 --> 00:08:18.169
Tao Sor!

00:08:18.369 --> 00:08:19.604
I'll go after him, Mom.

00:08:21.005 --> 00:08:21.872
Tao Sor!

00:09:08.219 --> 00:09:09.053
Tao Sor!

00:09:09.620 --> 00:09:10.454
Tao Sor!

00:09:11.322 --> 00:09:12.189
Tao Sor!

00:09:12.590 --> 00:09:13.424
Tao Sor!

00:09:14.091 --> 00:09:14.925
Tao Sor!

00:09:17.628 --> 00:09:18.462
Tao Sor!

00:09:20.297 --> 00:09:21.298
Tao Sor, pleae don't be hurt.

00:09:25.670 --> 00:09:27.405
Tao Sor! Can you hear me?

00:09:30.841 --> 00:09:32.043
I love you, Tao Sor!

00:09:43.688 --> 00:09:44.789
You'll be fine, okay?

00:10:21.325 --> 00:10:22.226
Kim.

00:10:24.161 --> 00:10:25.830
When will you understand?

00:10:28.632 --> 00:10:31.602
Every time he finds out the truth, he turns out like this.

00:10:33.604 --> 00:10:36.607
You might think I'm selfish for lying to Tao Sor.

00:10:38.375 --> 00:10:41.746
But what good comes from him finding out the truth?

00:10:45.816 --> 00:10:47.685
Before you met Tao Sor,

00:10:49.120 --> 00:10:51.622
it wasn't like this situation never happened.

00:10:54.258 --> 00:10:56.293
In the end, when Tao Sor wakes up.

00:10:58.629 --> 00:11:00.564
everything just disappears.

00:11:01.932 --> 00:11:03.768
There's just me and my family

00:11:04.802 --> 00:11:06.670
who still remember everything.

00:11:23.854 --> 00:11:26.857
I beg you, don't tak Tao Sor away from us.

00:11:43.707 --> 00:11:45.843
Our family has been broken up enough.

00:11:46.010 --> 00:11:47.978
Ever since Tao Sor left.

00:11:48.946 --> 00:11:51.182
But him coming back today...

00:11:51.749 --> 00:11:55.052
is like a reward for all of us.

00:12:01.258 --> 00:12:02.059
Tao Sor...

00:12:03.327 --> 00:12:05.429
is important to all of us.

00:12:17.408 --> 00:12:20.411
I ask of you, please return Tao Sor to us.

00:12:29.453 --> 00:12:31.188
I understand everyone's feelings.

00:12:33.290 --> 00:12:35.092
How losing someone can hurt so much.

00:12:35.826 --> 00:12:36.961
I also...

00:12:37.628 --> 00:12:40.631
lost a brother 10 years ago.

00:12:43.734 --> 00:12:46.737
But I've never thought of replacing him.

00:12:48.072 --> 00:12:49.673
Because in reality,

00:12:50.541 --> 00:12:53.544
no one can really replace anyone else.

00:12:57.214 --> 00:13:00.217
Please don't! Don't take Tao Sor away from me!

00:13:01.485 --> 00:13:03.187
Don't take Tao Sor away from us.

00:13:04.455 --> 00:13:05.456
Mom...

00:13:06.624 --> 00:13:09.627
Mom, get up.

00:13:16.300 --> 00:13:19.303
Dad, take Mom to go rest.

00:13:20.537 --> 00:13:22.072
Take care of your brother.

00:14:15.192 --> 00:14:16.627
What does his condition look like?

00:14:17.127 --> 00:14:18.829
His body is just exhausted,

00:14:19.330 --> 00:14:21.332
like he's been avoiding sleep for several days.

00:14:21.832 --> 00:14:23.467
Plus, he has face a stressful situation,

00:14:23.968 --> 00:14:25.703
so his body couldn't take it.

00:14:26.403 --> 00:14:30.374
But I gave him some meds and gave him an IV, he should be fine soon.

00:14:32.142 --> 00:14:33.143
So will this...

00:14:33.811 --> 00:14:35.913
have any effect on his memories?

00:14:39.683 --> 00:14:41.819
The brain didn't recieve any trauma,

00:14:42.486 --> 00:14:44.188
but in the case of memories...

00:14:44.722 --> 00:14:46.256
we'll have to take another look when he wakes up.

00:14:47.324 --> 00:14:49.326
He might remember everything.

00:14:50.060 --> 00:14:51.128
Or...

00:14:52.363 --> 00:14:53.864
he might not remember anything,

00:14:54.431 --> 00:14:56.033
like how you wanted.

00:15:02.072 --> 00:15:03.507
I'm asking seriously,

00:15:04.708 --> 00:15:05.743
Don't you get tired?

00:15:06.143 --> 00:15:07.144
Of course I do.

00:15:08.612 --> 00:15:09.813
But I have to do it.

00:15:12.082 --> 00:15:14.218
It's really the best thing for everyone.

00:15:24.728 --> 00:15:26.630
If you're tired, you should get some rest.

00:15:27.965 --> 00:15:29.466
Thank you so much.

00:15:32.002 --> 00:15:33.404
For never leaving me.

00:15:53.457 --> 00:15:54.625
You guys...

00:15:56.894 --> 00:15:59.463
why isn't everyone asleep?

00:16:00.864 --> 00:16:02.433
We were waiting for you.

00:16:03.367 --> 00:16:05.469
How was it? Did you see her?

00:16:08.405 --> 00:16:12.376
It's okay. I'll find a way to contact her.

00:16:12.776 --> 00:16:16.747
No matter what, Tao Sor has to be able to met his real mother.

00:16:17.748 --> 00:16:18.682
I think...

00:16:20.851 --> 00:16:21.785
you don't have to.

00:16:22.753 --> 00:16:25.722
Why are you sighing like that?

00:16:32.329 --> 00:16:33.430
Sometimes...

00:16:35.165 --> 00:16:37.468
him not being able to remember...

00:16:39.269 --> 00:16:41.472
could be a good thing for Tao Sor.

00:16:43.574 --> 00:16:44.308
And...

00:16:45.409 --> 00:16:47.811
you're gonna just let him forget you so easily?

00:16:51.949 --> 00:16:54.952
I'm only here for a year,

00:16:55.219 --> 00:16:58.222
I don't see why I have to get attached to anyone.

00:17:03.694 --> 00:17:06.697
And can you really forget him, Kim?

00:17:24.815 --> 00:17:26.049
Hey.

00:17:26.950 --> 00:17:30.787
If you want to cry, just let it out. You don't have to be strong all the time.

00:17:39.163 --> 00:17:40.831
Wrong person!

00:17:41.165 --> 00:17:42.232
It's not wrong.

00:17:43.033 --> 00:17:44.168
It's the same for you.

00:17:44.801 --> 00:17:46.537
You don't have to be strong all the time.

00:17:46.904 --> 00:17:50.240
You can show some weakness, I won't tell anyone.

00:17:56.647 --> 00:17:59.650
To be honest, sometimes...

00:18:00.751 --> 00:18:03.921
you don't have to keep forgetting about him.

00:18:06.089 --> 00:18:07.891
It's not even your fault.

00:18:09.293 --> 00:18:11.161
No one wants things like this to happen.

00:18:14.898 --> 00:18:17.901
We should just the remember the good moments,

00:18:18.202 --> 00:18:20.003
don't let anyone take those memories away.

00:18:26.410 --> 00:18:27.844
I love you, Sang.

00:18:29.613 --> 00:18:31.615
I love you too, Kim.

00:18:34.885 --> 00:18:37.888
I also love the both of you.

00:20:07.444 --> 00:20:09.046
Tao Sor.

00:20:13.483 --> 00:20:15.185
Who are you?

00:20:17.921 --> 00:20:19.523
What is this place?

00:20:20.090 --> 00:20:21.091
And...

00:20:22.259 --> 00:20:23.260
who am I?

00:20:23.627 --> 00:20:24.961
Your name is Tao Sor.

00:20:25.862 --> 00:20:27.464
You're my little brother.

00:20:28.732 --> 00:20:30.367
I don't remember that?

00:20:39.409 --> 00:20:40.544
It's okay.

00:20:42.612 --> 00:20:44.481
It's good that you don't remember.

00:21:56.019 --> 00:21:59.022
Hello, Chef Mochi. I'm Daiji.

00:22:03.093 --> 00:22:04.060
Oh...

00:22:05.495 --> 00:22:07.063
Talay's told me already.

00:22:07.798 --> 00:22:08.732
Really?

00:22:09.499 --> 00:22:10.634
What did he say?

00:22:11.701 --> 00:22:13.036
He said that...

00:22:13.703 --> 00:22:15.972
you were my assistant in the kitchen.

00:22:16.440 --> 00:22:18.642
You make great international food,

00:22:19.576 --> 00:22:20.744
as for me,

00:22:21.878 --> 00:22:23.814
I make Thai food and Chinese food.

00:22:27.751 --> 00:22:29.019
Anything else?

00:22:29.586 --> 00:22:32.589
You are a friend he loves dearly.

00:22:34.424 --> 00:22:35.258
And you...

00:22:36.226 --> 00:22:38.028
also love me very much.

00:22:41.231 --> 00:22:43.867
So what are you doing now?

00:22:45.001 --> 00:22:46.069
I'm drawing.

00:22:48.672 --> 00:22:50.173
You want me to hang out here with you?

00:22:53.710 --> 00:22:54.478
It's okay.

00:22:59.583 --> 00:23:02.586
Okay. See you soon, then!

00:24:53.797 --> 00:24:55.131
I've come to pay my respects to you.

00:24:56.099 --> 00:24:58.501
I apologize for coming so late.

00:24:59.536 --> 00:25:03.873
I don't know...if I came here earlier, would you have helped me achieve my wishes in love.

00:25:05.475 --> 00:25:07.510
But if I asked you to help me now,

00:25:08.211 --> 00:25:09.412
would you help me?

00:25:29.532 --> 00:25:30.533
A person like you...

00:25:31.267 --> 00:25:32.902
believes in Holy Power too?

00:25:34.471 --> 00:25:35.305
What about you?

00:25:36.373 --> 00:25:37.874
Did you get anything you asked for?

00:25:38.475 --> 00:25:40.176
I asked for Tao Sor to come back.

00:25:44.280 --> 00:25:45.482
I won't ask the gods for anything.

00:25:48.618 --> 00:25:50.520
But there's something I want to ask from you.

00:25:56.893 --> 00:25:58.762
In a few days, I'll be going back to Bangkok.

00:26:00.130 --> 00:26:03.133
I want Tao Sor's cooking for my last meal here.

00:26:22.152 --> 00:26:23.386
Does it look good, Dad?

00:26:24.921 --> 00:26:25.989
It's so cute, Kim.

00:26:38.702 --> 00:26:40.070
Did you know?

00:26:41.371 --> 00:26:43.073
I love Southern Fish Curry!

00:26:43.173 --> 00:26:44.574
Southern Fish Curry?

00:26:45.241 --> 00:26:46.743
When did you start liking this?

00:26:46.876 --> 00:26:50.313
I've known you all your life, I've never seen you eat this.

00:26:50.880 --> 00:26:52.282
Someone showed me how to eat it.

00:26:52.949 --> 00:26:54.818
Someone showed you?

00:26:54.984 --> 00:26:56.820
Wait till you see my dish!

00:27:01.758 --> 00:27:03.226
Happy Birthday, bro!

00:27:03.593 --> 00:27:09.332
Hope you stay handsome, get richer, and finally find true love.

00:27:14.637 --> 00:27:15.839
That might be a bit hard.

00:27:16.506 --> 00:27:17.774
Once I'm back in Bangkok,

00:27:19.075 --> 00:27:21.077
would I be able to find anyone?

00:27:24.781 --> 00:27:25.782
You find someone.

00:27:29.152 --> 00:27:30.353
How's the food?

00:27:31.221 --> 00:27:32.388
We haven't had any yet.

00:27:32.856 --> 00:27:34.457
Everything looks really good!

00:27:37.660 --> 00:27:38.828
Thank you, Talay!

00:27:39.395 --> 00:27:41.030
Once I'm back in Bangkok...

00:27:42.699 --> 00:27:44.701
I'm gonna miss Phuket food to death.

00:27:46.536 --> 00:27:47.704
Enjoy your meal.

00:27:49.139 --> 00:27:52.442
Happy Birthday to you,

00:27:52.909 --> 00:27:56.946
Happy Birthday to you,

00:28:04.220 --> 00:28:06.156
Make a wish, Sir.

00:28:23.573 --> 00:28:24.574
Tao Sor.

00:28:24.941 --> 00:28:25.975
Go home.

00:28:27.777 --> 00:28:29.112
You wanna go running today?

00:28:30.013 --> 00:28:31.614
Can we do something else?

00:28:59.876 --> 00:29:00.577
I'm sorry.

00:29:01.678 --> 00:29:04.747
It's okay. I'll have someone clean this up.

00:29:15.792 --> 00:29:16.860
Thank you.

00:29:28.104 --> 00:29:29.472
Please excuse me.

00:29:29.772 --> 00:29:30.907
Thank you..

00:29:36.880 --> 00:29:38.181
I don't have a fork.

00:29:40.617 --> 00:29:41.517
Here.

00:32:44.033 --> 00:32:47.136
Kim, there's another tour for Wat Arun booked for today.

00:32:47.136 --> 00:32:49.639
But all the guides are busy, will you take them yourself?

00:32:52.241 --> 00:32:54.110
Tell them that we're fully booked for today,

00:32:54.677 --> 00:32:56.813
If they want to go, they'll have to book for tomorrow.

00:32:57.280 --> 00:32:58.214
Okay.

00:33:08.224 --> 00:33:10.993
Kim, shall we go have Phuket food for dinner tonight?

00:33:11.260 --> 00:33:13.463
I know that you miss Phuket.

00:33:16.499 --> 00:33:17.333
Sure, Mom.

00:33:17.900 --> 00:33:20.036
You want to try arranging new trips?

00:33:20.837 --> 00:33:25.041
When you were in Phuket, your uncle wouldn't stop complimenting you.

00:33:28.077 --> 00:33:29.345
I'd rather not, Mom.

00:33:29.779 --> 00:33:32.782
I'm already overwhelmed with the work as is!

00:33:33.082 --> 00:33:34.984
Okay, I won't disturb you any longer.

00:33:49.699 --> 00:33:51.334
Hello? What's up, Siw?

00:33:51.567 --> 00:33:53.870
Someone misses your 1 Day Trip.

00:33:56.305 --> 00:33:57.073
Who?

00:33:57.874 --> 00:34:00.276
Nao. Who'd you think it was?

00:34:03.179 --> 00:34:03.813
Well...

00:34:04.647 --> 00:34:05.948
I wasn't thinking of anyone.

00:34:06.349 --> 00:34:09.051
Don't play dumb. We're all grown ups here.

00:34:10.520 --> 00:34:11.587
So...

00:34:12.388 --> 00:34:14.824
by the way, have you been to that resort lately?

00:34:15.258 --> 00:34:19.195
Since the day we sent you off, I haven't been back there at all.

00:34:20.463 --> 00:34:24.033
Kim, you don't have to keep pushing down the things you don't forget.

00:34:24.333 --> 00:34:25.835
Weren't you the one who said that?

00:34:30.473 --> 00:34:33.476
I'll go visit when I have time, okay?

00:34:33.943 --> 00:34:35.178
Hurry back!

00:34:35.411 --> 00:34:38.581
I think there might be someone waiting for you.

00:34:43.753 --> 00:34:45.188
He...

00:34:46.155 --> 00:34:49.158
might..not remember anything at all.

00:34:50.560 --> 00:34:51.827
Oh, Kim.

00:34:52.995 --> 00:34:54.297
Don't think like that.

00:34:57.633 --> 00:34:58.568
That's all.

00:34:59.569 --> 00:35:01.437
Oay, Kim. See you!

00:35:21.857 --> 00:35:24.460
Wait here, Tao Sor. I'm gonna go to the bathroom.

00:35:25.228 --> 00:35:25.795
Okay.

00:37:17.506 --> 00:37:18.774
Tao Sor!

00:38:08.557 --> 00:38:11.026
What's wrong? Why are you crying?

00:38:14.997 --> 00:38:16.065
Oh.

00:38:16.932 --> 00:38:17.733
It's nothing.

00:38:32.114 --> 00:38:32.815
Tao Sor!

00:38:33.349 --> 00:38:34.550
why did you do this?

00:38:35.317 --> 00:38:36.018
Let's go.

00:39:05.748 --> 00:39:06.615
Bro...

00:39:09.585 --> 00:39:11.353
I dreamt of a man...

00:39:14.990 --> 00:39:16.492
I don't know who he is...

00:39:20.863 --> 00:39:22.598
I hear his voice,

00:39:24.200 --> 00:39:25.501
see only his shadow,

00:39:26.335 --> 00:39:28.370
but it was so real.

00:39:32.775 --> 00:39:34.410
I know him, right?

00:39:37.780 --> 00:39:38.981
I give in, Tao Sor.

00:39:41.317 --> 00:39:42.985
I'll take you to see him.